**/.circleci
**/.editorconfig
**/.dockerignore
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/node_modules

# Specific patterns to ignore
data-node
meili_data*
librechat*
Dockerfile*
docs

# Built inside the image from source — excluding host-built output avoids
# shipping stale/host-specific artifacts and sidesteps a race where a
# background file sync (e.g. OneDrive) can corrupt the build-context
# transfer if these are being written to on the host mid-build.
**/dist

# Ignore all hidden files
.*
